# Food Coma (CR 608.2b): the exile and the Food are one ability, so with its only target illegal on resolution it does nothing at
# all. Bot1 casts Food Coma aiming at Bot2's Ornithopter; in response Bot2 exiles its own Ornithopter with Swords to Plowshares.
# The ability is countered on resolution: Bot1 gets no Food token (the Ornithopter has power 0, so Bot2 gains no life).

